                <pb facs="0631" n="551" xml:id="pg551"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and Great Britain concerning the
                    establishment of import duties in Zanzibar.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington May 31, 1902.<lb/>Ratification with
                        amendment advised by the Smote June 30, 1902.<lb/>Ratified by the President
                        July 22, 1902.<lb/>Ratified by Great Britain August 27,
                        1902.<lb/>Ratifications exchanged at Washington October 17,
                        1902.<lb/>Proclaimed October 17, 1902.</hi></p>

